							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I believe I was first on Necro epic.&nbsp; Was Sept 22nd before the patch.<br /><br />A few minutes before mine, we completed SK epic for Daewood.<br /><br />Either way can add Dae to the list.<br /><br />--<br />Mephiss<br />&lt;Hegemony&gt;<br />
