	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11471"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=866" title="View the profile of Fyrestarter">Fyrestarter</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 2<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=866"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg11471#msg11471"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg11471#msg11471">Re: History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #176 on:</b> September 29, 2004, 12:59:02 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I was the first 50 Human wizard on Rodcet&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm1.gif" alt="cwm1" border="0" /><br /><br />While Tirran and Dajal are pretty close to accurate, they both stopped playing for quite some time/became dissinterested in the responsibilities.&nbsp; While I was never given leadership from Dajal, I ran Guardians of the Malt for almost 6 - 7 months (Fornza/Chaffee were my new recruits before I stopped playing).. during that time we were one of the only 3 or 4 guilds able to break Fear (AoD/AL/EK?? was a while ago), and were part of the 4 or so able to do Hate (AoD/AL/EK/HoS??).&nbsp; We killed Nagafen (sp?) numerous times and I think we dropped Vox once (all of this before kunark) in the hayday.&nbsp; At one point in time I was tied for the most carmine on the server (which - was fairly by luck because GoTM started doing fear just after they switched from the single caster gear (blanking on it&#039;s name) to individual class gear.<br /><br />I was still &quot;leader&quot; for quite some time into Kunark, and actually - I met fornza when he was lvl 12 (barely months before kunark came out) and taught him how to play the wizard class and twinked him out because he was a nice guy (and I was mad rich because of being 50 for so long and solo&#039;ing thick banded belt spawn for days at a time) - needless to say he took the tricks of the trade and ran with it from there.&nbsp; He later joined the malts once he was of appropriate level - this is near just before when I stopped playing the game for a long time.&nbsp; At this point malts was long gone and I think I was nearly an Ascent member but dropped out of the recruitment process due to a lack of interest in the game.&nbsp; I was pretty good friends with Xanthorian at the time and he asked me to app to them because they needed wizards.<br /><br />I came back sorta-mid PoP when asked from Chammy/Adres to help form Conviction, who at that time was an app to RoS and became good friends with Vosh/Llew/Disso.&nbsp; I&#039;ve been in conviction since, despite having the officers try to force me out several times&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
