							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							and oh yeah.. I hate Fin De Tricycle and most of it&#039;s members!&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/approve.gif" alt="approve" border="0" /><br /><br />They were bastards that ditched Luna Imperium back when, and Cirdan (sp?) and I ran it for a bit after that, but the support wasn&#039;t there to really do anything with it.
